outlook.com","description":"Free browser-based tools for developers, creators, PDF, image, ecommerce, and AI workflows. Fast online utilities with privacy-friendly local processing.","knowsAbout":["browser-based developer tools","client-side data processing","PDF workflow utilities","image optimization","AI-assisted productivity","ecommerce operations tools","technical writing for practical workflows"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"luowj1998@outlook.com","contactType":"customer support","availableLanguage":["English","Chinese"]},"publishingPrinciples":"https://toolorbit.site/about"},"inLanguage":"zh-CN"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Base64 编码是加密吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不，Base64 是一种编码方案，不是加密算法。它的目的是将二进制数据表示为 ASCII 文本，以便在仅支持文本的协议（如电子邮件或 URL）中传输。任何拿到 Base64 字符串的人都可以轻松解码它。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"为什么我的中文字符在 Base64 转换后变成乱码？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"这通常是因为没有正确处理 UTF-8 编码。我们的工具会先将文本转换为 UTF-8 字节流再进行 Base64 编码，因此能够完美支持所有 Unicode 字符（包括表情符号）。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Base64 编码会增加文件体积吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"是的，Base64 编码后的数据比原始二进制数据大约增加 33%。因此，它通常用于传输小型数据片段（如 DataURI），而不适合传输超大文件。"}}]}]0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"language":"zh","children":[["$","template",null,{"id":"structured-data-tool-base64","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4",null,null]}],["$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La"],"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"bYYi-ZPGnf7tmCL1WLFhj"}
